- 168 Four embossed flower-vasesin case;two muffineers, chased with palm leaves; a circular bowl, with scroll handle;
- and various small muffineers,vases, &amp;c.
- A silver-mounted glass claret-jug; three ditto scent-bottles; a glass fask, with silver-gilt mounts; two silver-mounted glass inkstands ; and various glass muffineers, &amp;c.
